{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design", "label": "Design System Foundation & Theme Toggle Design (A)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-netis-design-system-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design_token_system", "label": "CSS Design Token System", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-netis-design-system-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Components style through CSS custom properties only \u2014 never redefined inside media queries \u2014 so both themes stay in sync and explicit data-theme always wins over the OS preference in both directions. Dark palette must stay identical in three places (media query, data-theme=dark, data-theme=light re-assert)."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design_theme_toggle", "label": "Theme Toggle (localStorage, no-flash bootstrap)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-netis-design-system-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Theme is a personal per-browser preference; localStorage avoids a server round-trip and is correct for the multi-user model (each admin/viewer keeps their own choice) \u2014 no store or settings change. Inline head script runs before first paint so a dark-preferring user sees no light flash; default dark. try/catch around localStorage falls back to the media query so a theme always renders."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design_component_set", "label": "Reusable Component Set (.card/.pill/.chip/.seg/.dialog)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-netis-design-system-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One card definition replaces overlapping .card/.panel/.auth-card/.stat/.badge treatments \u2014 fixing them to one definition is what removes the misaligned borders on settings and onboarding. A ships the components so sub-projects B and C become markup-only."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design_emoji_icons", "label": "Emoji Device Icons", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-netis-design-system-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Icons are emoji: zero embedded assets, theme-agnostic, universally rendered; the icon picker becomes an emoji palette. A defines the kind-to-default-emoji mapping constant and the .ic tile; B/C consume it."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design_token_system", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-netis-design-system-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design_theme_toggle", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-netis-design-system-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_07_12_netis_design_system_design_component_set", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-1